                <p>Source: Reagan Library, Robert H. Lilac Files, Arms Transfer: Country Files, AT:
                    Yugoslavia [January 1981–April 1981]. Secret. Sent for action. Copies were sent
                    to Bush, Meese, Baker, and Deaver. “The
                    President has seen” is stamped at the top of the memorandum. Beneath this
